      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_18",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("It is said that the battle with the North Elves was the beginning of the end for Landar’s revolt. But civil war smoldered on for many more years, neither side mustering enough strength to achieve a decisive victory. Until, eventually, Landar’s increasingly harsh and arrogant ways drove away many of his followers. After assembling all the troops he could, Kalenz marched against his old friend and now mortal enemy, Landar, in the forest of Gitamoth..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "loyal_19",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            units: "Kalenz",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "clock_20",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "turn_limit",
            value: 21,
